        "name": "Mark Kretschmann",
        "text": "Grok's text watermarking is now off by default in the SpaceXSI API.\n\nElon Musk confirmed it and went further. He says text watermarking with Grok is only on where the law requires it or a user asks for it.\n\nSo if you build on Grok, your output won't carry a hidden watermark unless you switch it on or a law requires one.",
